# NOT ignored, deliberately, and the reason is the same one that keeps
# fii_dii_history.csv out of data/cache/:
#   outputs/breach_log.csv  -- the dated record of when the book was outside its
#                              limits. It accumulates, it cannot be reconstructed,
#                              and it is the only artefact here that answers a
#                              question about the past.
#   outputs/ic_memo.md      -- the deliverable; committing it makes the memo's
#                              history reviewable alongside the code that produced it.
